  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6b/Baptiste.png/revision/latest?cb=20260829144636\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Baptiste\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6b/Baptiste.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20260829144636\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Baptiste</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-characters-29468\" title=\"Category:Characters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">non-player character</a> (NPC) who manages the Design Festival event. He was introduced in early 2025, along with the event.\n</p><p>Baptiste is a French photographer who has a stall near <a href=\"/wiki/maggie-29376\" title=\"Maggie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Maggie</a>'s workbench. When there's a Design Festival happening, he walks around the farm, taking photos. The event allows players to design a decoration arrangement based on a given theme and earn rewards.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831161534\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36757-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831161534 and revision id 110961. Rendering w