  "wikitext": "[[File:Baptiste.png|200px|left]]\n'''Baptiste''' is a [[:Category:Characters|non-player character]] (NPC) who manages the Design Festival event. He was introduced in early 2025, along with the event.\n\nBaptiste is a French photographer who has a stall near [[Maggie]]'s workbench. When there's a Design Festival happening, he walks around the farm, taking photos. The event allows players to design a decoration arrangement based on a given theme and earn rewards.\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Incomplete]]",
